    "How this app finds the LocalDevVPN tunnel: it waits for the tunnel IP on an interface, then probes the peer's lockdown port. %@ These steer this app only — the vendored library finds the peer from the route table and always dials 62078.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会等待网络接口获得指定的隧道 IP，然后探测对端的 lockdown 端口，以定位 LocalDevVPN 隧道。%@ 这些设置只影响本应用；内置库会通过路由表定位对端并始终连接 62078 端口。"
          }
        }
      }
