    "Looping decodes the video to JPEG frames and hands PosterBoard a CoreAnimation frame list (up to %lld frames, at the video's own resolution). It is slow, and the frames are written into the backup, so a long clip makes a large one — trim it first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "循环模式会将视频解码为 JPEG 帧，并交给 PosterBoard 的 CoreAnimation 帧序列处理（最多 %lld 帧，保留视频原始分辨率）。处理速度较慢，帧数据会写入备份，长视频将占用大量空间，建议先剪辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
