    "On by default, as upstream does. Off: an apply carries only the tweaks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认开启，与上游一致。关闭后，应用操作只包含系统修改项目。"
