    },
    "On iOS 26, show tweaks outside their tested iOS version range. Hardware requirements still apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iOS 26 上显示超出已测试系统版本范围的修改项目，硬件限制仍然生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: an apply adds two files ahead of the tweaks, in this order —": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，应用操作会在系统修改文件之前按顺序添加两个文件："
          }
        }
      }
    },
