    "Select the pages you would like to reset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择要重置的页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected: %@. A reset is written as a 0-byte file over the folder, which is how the reference clears them; it runs without needing the store database, so it is the recovery path for a store that is already misbehaving. It does not undo anything already applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已选择：%@。重置会向目标文件夹写入 0 字节文件，与参考实现的清理方式一致。此过程无需壁纸数据库，可用于修复已出现异常的数据库，但不会撤销此前应用的修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
