            "value": "模板错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Templates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PC version does this for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑版可以自动完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PC version's Mobile Helper is the easiest route. The two cards below are fallbacks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用电脑版的 Mobile Helper 最为简便。下方两种方式可作为备用方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Status Bar reset is the one file here that is written whole, not nulled: a fresh, all-default %@ It goes through the same mechanism the Status Bar page applies with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态栏重置是这里唯一会写入完整内容而非清空的文件：一个全新的默认 %@。其应用机制与状态栏页面相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The choices you do not pick are deleted before the files are delivered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未选择的内容将在传输文件之前删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chosen files are renamed to: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件将重命名为：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device's AFC service published nothing here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备的 AFC 服务没有在此提供任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device's existing cloud configuration is not merged in (reading it needs a lockdown service this port has no path for), and no keybag certificate is generated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不会合并设备现有的云端配置，因为读取它需要本移植版尚不支持的 lockdown 服务；也不会生成密钥包证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live-photo method writes the video into a Photos poster descriptor and needs a freeze frame — the reference raises rather than shipping a descriptor with no thumbnail. The video is rewrapped as .mov unless it already is one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片方式会将视频写入“照片”壁纸描述文件，并要求提供定格画面。缺少缩略图时将拒绝应用。除非视频本身已是 .mov 格式，否则会重新封装为 .mov。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only template selected asks for sparserestore, which this app does not implement, so nothing is delivered from the Templates page and this run is not started for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选模板只包含 sparserestore 操作，而此应用尚未实现该功能，因此模板页面不会传输文件，也不会为其启动操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The switches below are live for the next run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下开关将在下次操作中生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is on iOS %@, which reads a legacy pack as it is, so nothing is converted here and no pack is asked about.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前设备运行 iOS %@，可以直接读取旧版壁纸包，因此无需转换，也不会提示转换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feature is hidden by HotLoad safety rules. See Settings for rule status.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能已被 HotLoad 安全规则隐藏。请在设置中查看规则状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not all tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此处未列出所有修改项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This preset contains daemon modifications that were saved for a different device:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设包含为其他设备保存的守护进程修改："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This toggle writes a value other than on/off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此开关写入的值不只是开启或关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will replace your current configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作将替换当前配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
