    "Wallet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallet Cards (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱包卡片（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpaper packs (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸包（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpapers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpapers are delivered as files into this app's own backup of the device, in the %@ domain — the same channel the tweaks use. Nothing is written to the device until Apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸会以文件形式放入应用创建的设备备份中，使用 %@ 域，与系统修改使用相同通道。点击“应用”之前不会向设备写入任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字重"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Signal Bars": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi 信号格数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes %lld file(s) to the device:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 %lld 个文件写入设备："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes /var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist. Disabling a daemon stops its service. Only the %lld labels shown here can ever reach the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入 /var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist。禁用守护进程将停止其服务。只有此处展示的 %lld 个项目可能写入该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes a 0-byte file over %@. Upstream models this as a NullifyFileTweak: it removes a plist rather than writing one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向 %@ 写入 0 字节文件。上游将此行为称为 NullifyFileTweak：删除 plist 内容，而非写入新内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes the descriptors into %@ over a tunnel and resprings, so it is live in seconds. No backup is taken, because nothing is delivered back to the device — but for the same reason it applies **only** the packs: tweaks need the backup, so they still go through the **Apply** button on the home page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过隧道将描述文件写入 %@ 并重启桌面，因此可快速生效。此操作不创建备份，也不会向设备回写备份；因此**仅适用于壁纸包**。系统修改仍需备份，必须使用首页的**应用**按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can get more tweaks, but they are untested with your iOS version. You can change your mind in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以使用更多修改项目，但它们尚未在当前 iOS 版本上测试。你可以随时在设置中更改此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your selection is saved to %@ on every change and restored on launch, exactly as the desktop app's AutoSave preset does (%@). Import is for a preset from elsewhere; entries this port does not carry are listed below rather than guessed at.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your selection is saved to %1$@ on every change and restored on launch, exactly as the desktop app's AutoSave preset does (%2$@). Import is for a preset from elsewhere; entries this port does not carry are listed below rather than guessed at."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次修改都会自动保存到 %@，并在启动时恢复，与电脑版的 AutoSave 预设一致（%@）。导入功能用于加载其他来源的预设，本移植版不支持的条目会单独列出，不会擅自推测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS %@: each nulled file is written as a valid empty plist, not 0 bytes. A 0-byte plist is a truncated plist on this release and crashes SpringBoard at boot. An empty plist parses, and the system falls back to its own defaults.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS %@：每个待清空的文件都将写入有效的空 plist，而不是 0 字节文件。在此版本中，0 字节 plist 被视为截断文件，会导致 SpringBoard 启动时崩溃。有效的空 plist 可以正确解析，并使系统回退到默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 builds the depth effect only for the modern (“Clownfish”) layout, so a pack made before iOS 27 is rewritten when it is applied — otherwise it installs and looks flat, with no depth. The rewrite re-stamps the family, drops external scripts and republishes the planes, and it is best effort: it can change how a wallpaper looks. A pack holding nothing pre-27 is left alone either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 仅为现代（“Clownfish”）布局生成景深效果，因此应用 iOS 27 之前制作的壁纸包时会重新转换，否则安装后将显示为无景深的平面壁纸。转换会更新布局系列标记、移除外部脚本并重新生成图层，可能改变壁纸外观。完全不包含旧格式内容的壁纸包不会被修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 only applies the depth effect to wallpapers in the modern format, so a legacy wallpaper is rewritten on import. Pick “Install as is” to push the original files untouched instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只对现代格式壁纸启用景深效果，因此导入旧版壁纸时会进行转换。选择“按原样安装”可不经转换直接写入原文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 status bar research": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 状态栏研究"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27+ — on iOS 26, use a file from a computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 及更新版本 — iOS 26 请使用电脑生成的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing saved yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未保存任何内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "statusBarOverrides struct, so every override reads as off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "statusBarOverrides 结构体，因此所有覆盖项都会视为关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the classic struct": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经典结构体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the iOS 27 archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 归档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tunnel: %@ · peer %@:%u reachable: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "tunnel: %1$@ · peer %2$@:%3$u reachable: %4$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道：%@ · 对端 %@:%u 可连接：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "value": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在处理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "≈ %@ remaining": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "约剩余 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "≈ %lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "约 %lld 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠ Low battery: %lld%%. Connect the charger before restoring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠ 电量不足：%lld%%。请先连接充电器，再执行恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠ Low storage: %.1f GB free. Restoring tweaks may require at least %.1f GB free and could fail if the device runs out of space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "⚠ Low storage: %1$.1f GB free. Restoring tweaks may require at least %2$.1f GB free and could fail if the device runs out of space."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠ 存储空间不足：剩余 %.1f GB。恢复修改至少可能需要 %.1f GB 可用空间，空间耗尽可能导致失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ A PosterBoard reset is armed (%@). A reset run clears the store and installs no wallpapers, so with wallpapers selected as well Apply refuses until one of the two is turned off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠️ 已启用 PosterBoard 重置（%@）。重置会清空壁纸数据库，不会安装壁纸。如果同时选中壁纸，应用操作将被拒绝，必须先取消其中一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
